1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,720
Why was their disguise 'too perfect'?
为什么他们的伪装“太完美了”？

2
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:14,730
Why was their disguise 'too perfect'?
为什么他们的伪装“太完美了”？

3
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:26,950
An ancient bus stopped by a dry river bed and a party of famous actors and actresses got off.
一辆旧公共汽车停在一条干涸的河床边，一群著名的男女演员下了车。

4
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:30,910
Dressed in dark glasses and old clothes,
他们戴着墨镜、穿着旧衣服，

5
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:36,200
they had taken special precautions so that no one should recognize them.
采取了特别的预防措施，以免被人认出来。

6
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:43,860
But as they soon discovered, disguises can sometimes be too perfect.
但他们很快就发现，伪装有时会太完美了。

7
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:50,590
'This is a wonderful place for a picnic,' said Gloria Gleam.
“这是个野餐的好地方，”格洛丽亚·格利姆说。

8
00:00:51,950 --> 00:00:56,240
'It couldn't be better, Gloria,' Brinksley Meers agreed.
“再好不过了，格洛丽亚，”布林克斯利·米尔斯表示同意。

9
00:00:57,430 --> 00:01:01,700
'No newspaper men, no film fans! Why don't we come more often?'
“没有记者，也没有影迷！我们为什么不多来几次呢？”

10
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:09,780
Meanwhile, two other actors Rockwall Slinger and Merlin Greeves,
与此同时，另外两位演员罗克沃尔·斯林格和默林·格里夫斯

11
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:16,510
had carried two large food baskets to a shady spot under some trees.
把两个大食品篮搬到了树下的阴凉处。

12
00:01:17,940 --> 00:01:22,310
When they had all made themselves comfortable, a stranger appeared.
大家刚安顿好，一个陌生人出现了。

13
00:01:22,660 --> 00:01:24,630
He looked very angry.
他看上去非常生气。

14
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:30,570
'Now you get out of here, all of you!' he shouted.
“你们现在就出去，全都出去！”他喊道。

15
00:01:31,650 --> 00:01:40,920
'I'm sheriff here. Do you see that notice? It says "No Camping"--in case you can't read!'
“我是这里的治安官。你们看见那块告示了吗？上面写着‘禁止露营’——万一你们不识字呢！”

16
00:01:43,210 --> 00:01:45,380
'Look, sheriff,' said Rockwall,
“听我说，治安官，”罗克沃尔说，

17
00:01:46,750 --> 00:01:52,810
'don't be too hard on us. I'm Rockwall Slinger and this is Merlin Greeves.'
“别对我们太厉害。我是罗克沃尔·斯林格，这位是默林·格里夫斯。”

18
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:58,610
'Oh, is it?' said the sheriff with a sneer.
“哦，是吗？”治安官冷笑着说。

19
00:01:59,350 --> 00:02:01,950
'Well, I'm Brinksley Meers,
“那好，我是布林克斯利·米尔斯，

20
00:02:01,970 --> 00:02:04,780
and my other name is Gloria Gleam
我的另一个名字是格洛丽亚·格利姆。

21
00:02:04,890 --> 00:02:07,660
Now you get out of here fast!'
现在你们马上给我出去！”
